        <item>
            <title>0.6.54</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 11:54:23 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/tag/v0.6.54</link>
            <sparkle:version>87</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.54</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.54

- Makes Meeting Mode automatic Markdown export fail clearly when its selected folder is missing or unavailable instead of silently recreating it.
- Keeps automatic export off when the first folder picker is cancelled.
- Groups meeting storage options together and adds regression checks for successful and missing-folder exports.
]]></description>
