        <item>
            <title>0.6.51</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 08 Sep 2026 13:51:53 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/tag/v0.6.51</link>
            <sparkle:version>84</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.6.51</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Kiki 0.6.51

- Adds a real Home orientation screen with setup status, a three-step first-dictation guide, and equal-size actions for dictation, meetings, and audio import.
- Replaces the listening orb approximation with a native Metal port of OrbKit SHDR-21 Nimbus, using Templeton colors and distinct idle, thinking, and speaking motion states.
- Removes Voice Studio and local voice-cloning code, menus, assets, and MLX dependencies from the application.
- Preserves transcripts, dictionary entries, approved replacements, settings, and other existing local user data.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/templetongroup/Kiki/releases/download/v0.6.51/Kiki-0.6.51-macOS.zip" length="8691605" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="9rIwvb/wAgGp02xYAGWvLlIKfwxWqERtFxV5Ek/WlpANn/Aj0v6gLFnSi5dhmBBJSXZBKlrveCVDsNQgrpaTCg=="/>
